				<description type="str">High temperatures today will reach the lower to middle 90s.
Combined with the humidity, heat index values will rise to near or
just above 100 degrees this afternoon. If you have outdoor plans,
prepare for impacts from the heat by staying hydrated, wearing
cool, loose-fitting clothing and, taking frequent breaks in the
shade or in an air-conditioned location.</description>
